From 060079dd6e44cbd22180cf60e5c3a36314456f19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:42:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Home dashboard and simpler navigation

- Home: today's numbers (new leads vs the week before, appointments,
  conversations waiting, 90-day rating, money owed), a prioritized
  "needs your attention" list, upcoming appointments, due tasks, unanswered
  conversations, newest leads and a setup checklist. "Today" follows the
  business's time zone.
- Menu grouped by Customers, Marketing, AI, Money and Settings and filtered
  by account type and role; the classic console tools are one collapsible
  group shown only to platform staff.
- Phone: a five-item bottom bar with a "More" sheet instead of every page.
- Signed-in team users land on Home; deep links open the right inbox
  thread, CRM tab and new-contact form.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RPZCHpFd1FKcchaeMbmcMV
